# Node modules
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store

# Build outputs
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/out

# Development files
**/.env.local
**/.env.development.local
**/.env.test.local
**/.env.production.local

# Logs
**/logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*
**/lerna-debug.log*

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# IDE files
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~

# Test coverage
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output

# Temporary files
**/tmp
**/temp
**/.tmp

# Git
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# Documentation
**/docs
**/*.md
!**/README.md

# CI/CD
**/.github
**/.gitlab-ci.yml
**/.circleci

# Docker files (prevent recursive copying)
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore